      "context_before_exact": "MikroTik 文档表明可以在主机和容器之间创建挂载点。例如，etc文件夹下的disk1被挂载到/etc/pihole容器中：  ",
      "context_after_exact": "这个特性造成了三个相当危险的特定行为。  "
    },
    {
      "archive_empty_fence_opening_line": 79,
      "public_source_block_index": 3,
      "current_fence_opening_line": 89,
      "exact_literal_match_current": true,
      "full_source_block_text": "# ln -s / /rootfs",
      "source_text_sha256_recorded": "79d15fd9dc9111c74d1f376a3ddf96cedb88ebcd0906ffecee03ecab3c06f30a",
      "source_text_sha256_recomputed_utf8": "79d15fd9dc9111c74d1f376a3ddf96cedb88ebcd0906ffecee03ecab3c06f30a",
      "source_text_hash_matches": true,
      "source_cache_sha256_recorded": "5760fee8eba869362aaf0639027b03ff8331338301a5a95e4bb69c2d2f569e5f",
      "source_url_recorded": "https://blog.nns.ee/2022/08/05/routeros-container-rce/",
      "source_author_or_attribution": "Rasmus Moorats (nns)",
      "context_before_exact": "假设我的容器的根文件系统存储在disk1/alpine中， 我们在容器内执行以下操作：  ",
      "context_after_exact": "那么在容器内，根目录将按/rootfs解析。如果在 RouterOS 中设置容器时将此目录用作挂载源，符号链接则将根据设备自己的文件系统进行解析。  "
    },
    {
      "archive_empty_fence_opening_line": 85,
      "public_source_block_index": 4,
      "current_fence_opening_line": 96,
      "exact_literal_match_current": true,
      "full_source_block_text": "/container/mounts/add name=rootfs src=/disk1/alpine/rootfs dst=/mnt",
      "source_text_sha256_recorded": "f7d36acc59178d3f2e4ed0d7f591c9119282fef88eaefe9e64140c8991e57167",
      "source_text_sha256_recomputed_utf8": "f7d36acc59178d3f2e4ed0d7f591c9119282fef88eaefe9e64140c8991e57167",
      "source_text_hash_matches": true,
      "source_cache_sha256_recorded": "5760fee8eba869362aaf0639027b03ff8331338301a5a95e4bb69c2d2f569e5f",
      "source_url_recorded": "https://blog.nns.ee/2022/08/05/routeros-container-rce/",
      "source_author_or_attribution": "Rasmus Moorats (nns)",
      "context_before_exact": "例如，我将在容器/mnt目录中挂载主机文件系统：  ",
      "context_after_exact": "然后，从创建的容器内部就可以访问主机的根文件系统：  "
    },
    {
      "archive_empty_fence_opening_line": 89,
